OL,3,GNEWSALucky escape for man after car
OL,4,Acrashes into house
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man fears he could have been killed
OL,7,Fhad he been at home relaxing in his
OL,8,Fusual "chilling area" when a car
OL,9,Fcrashed into his house.
OL,11,FMario Lleshi, 22, said he had been at
OL,12,Fwork at the time of the crash but would
OL,13,Fnormally have been relaxing in the back
OL,14,Froom of the house he rents on Upper
OL,15,FRoad in Shrewsbury.
OL,17,FThat room is now just rubble with only
OL,18,Fthe supporting walls in place. Lleshi
OL,19,Fsaid: "Maybe I would be dead by now, or
OL,20,Fprobably badly injured in the
OL,21,Fhospital."
OL,23,APub: 15-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
